OL,3,GNEWSAThe Crown star Josh O'Connor
OL,4,Areacts to Bond rumours
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chosen actor will replace Daniel
OL,7,FCraig, who took over the role of Bond
OL,8,Fwith Casino Royale in 2006 and bowed
OL,9,Fout after his fifth film, No Time To
OL,10,FDie, in 2021.
OL,12,FOpening Everyman's new education and
OL,13,Fcommunity centre in his hometown,
OL,14,FO'Connor said: "To be considered in
OL,15,Fthat same sort of bracket is
OL,16,Fextraordinary".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
